# A Luxel library scene (Gitea #785) — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A warm ramp over a pattern, a sprite scaled up by `fit contain` (11x11 into a
# 22x22 box), and a greeting crawling along the bottom. The sun RISES and SETS
# on a 20 s keyframe track (`M` lines, docs/spec/scenes.md "Keyframes"): up
# from below the greeting while it fades in, a long hold at the L line's own
# spot (`=`), then down and out to the west; the loop restarts invisible.
S - Sunrise
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Glow
I @pat/coral-plasma
R 100 0:1b0b2e 80:8c2d4b 170:f4772e 230:ffd166 255:fff3c4
L sprite 4 3 22 22 normal 100 none contain 1
N Sun
I @spr/sun-spin
#   ms    x  y  opacity ease
M 0       0  24 0       linear
M 4000    =  =  100     out
M 16000   =  =  100     linear
M 20000   8  24 0       in
L text 0 26 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Greeting
T lit GOOD MORNING
F tiny ffd166 l left 12
